<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We’re gonna be God’s serving children,</l><l>Everyone help someone today.</l><l>Mom needs a hand; I have two for</l><l>Folding up the laundry and making stew.</l><l>We’re gonna be God’s serving children,</l><l>Everyone help someone today.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We’re gonna be God’s serving children,</l><l>We’re gonna serve someone today.</l><l>Dad needs a hand; I have two.</l><l>Taking out the trash is what I’ll do.</l><l>We’re gonna be God’s serving children,</l><l>We’re gonna serve someone today.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
